Transball GL: the keys
======================

  Q              thrust (it uses fuel: the gauge is at the top left)
  O, P           turn left, turn right
  Space          fire
  Return         the tractor beam: pick up the sphere
  A              the ship's special (shield, side thrusters, ...)
  Esc            the menu: pause, options, leave the level
  F12            quit

Every game key can be changed in Options, from the main menu or the game's
menu; the window or a full screen is chosen there too.

The aim: find the energy sphere, take it with the tractor beam and carry
it to the top of the level. Touch anything and the ship is lost.

In the menus the mouse picks; in the level editor the cursor keys or the
screen's edges move the map, Page Up and Page Down zoom.

Player profiles, high scores and the times are kept in the drawer's
players drawer, your replays in replays and your own levels in mymaps.
